// Five equal bars, 5:3, from the designer's image (2042 by 1225 pixels).
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Aroaceflux flag"
  designer "astraldomination (Tumblr)"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  date "2020-02-29"
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20220120153656/https://astraldomination.tumblr.com/post/611326365790322688/an-aroaceflux-design-based-on-toothcitys-aroflux"
  note "Designer's own Tumblr post, read from the Wayback snapshot above; the page's metadata dates it 2020-02-29. Its whole text is 'an aroaceflux design based on toothcity's aroflux and aceflux redesigns', so it gives no meanings, hex values or proportion, and toothcity's redesigns were not read."
  note "The colors were read from the post's flag image (the 500 by 300 copy Tumblr serves of a 2042 by 1225 original, fetched from Tumblr's media server): #f8575d, #fe7c85, #ffcde5, #6b8fd5, #3b3f94, in five equal bars of 60 pixels. They equal the values the LGBTQIA Fandom wiki's file page is reported to list (not read here). The proportion 5:3 is the image's."
  note "Other aroaceflux designs exist, among them one by aroaesflags (December 2018); this file is only astraldomination's."
}
palette {
  red "#f8575d"
  pink "#fe7c85"
  light-pink "#ffcde5"
  blue "#6b8fd5"
  dark-blue "#3b3f94"
}
proportion hoist=3 fly=5

bars red pink light-pink blue dark-blue
